cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper.
title: Dynamic LCZ Projection
abstract: >-
  Projects how the built surface of a city changes to 2100 under each Shared
  Socioeconomic Pathway, and downscales climate onto every projected surface at 1 km.
